---
const { isZh = false } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="hero" aria-label="Hero" id="overview">
  <div class="hero__bg">
    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1508804185872-d7badad00f7d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1920&q=85" alt="" aria-hidden="true" fetchpriority="high" />
  </div>
  <div class="hero__overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="container hero__content">
    <p class="hero__eyebrow">
      {isZh
        ? <><span>2026 夏季 · 文化系列</span><br/><span class="hero__eyebrow-club">UofT 探索旅行社团</span></>
        : <><span>Summer 2026 · Culture Series</span><br/><span class="hero__eyebrow-club">UofT Exploration and Travel Club</span></>
      }
    </p>
    <h1 class="hero__title">{isZh ? <>探索<br/>中国</> : <>Explore<br/>China</>}</h1>
    <p class="hero__label">{isZh ? '由 UofT 探索旅行社团发起的学生主导旅行项目，在中国各地有专业本地合作伙伴支持。' : 'A student-led travel program by the UofT Exploration & Travel Club, supported by local partners across China.'}</p>
    <p class="hero__sub">{isZh ? '10天行程，专业双语导游，以及在华的 UofT 学生全程陪同——深度探索、体验和了解中国文化。' : '10 days, professional bilingual guides, and UofT students in China as co-leads — built to explore, experience, and understand culture from the inside.'}</p>
    <div class="hero__cta-group">
      {isZh
        ? <a href="#itinerary" class="btn--hero-primary">查看路线</a>
        : <button type="button" id="btn-review-story" class="btn--hero-primary">Review Our Story</button>
      }
      <a href="https://www.instagram.com/camcapysoc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn--hero-ghost">{isZh ? '往期行程 ↗' : 'Previous Trips ↗'}</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="hero__poem" aria-hidden="true">
    {isZh
      ? <><span>不只是旅行。</span><br/><span>真正感受一个截然不同的世界。</span></>
      : <><span>Not just a trip.</span><br/><span>A chance to feel a world that is genuinely different.</span></>
    }
  </p>

  <div class="hero__scroll-hint" aria-hidden="true">
    <span>Scroll</span>
    <div class="hero__scroll-line"></div>
  </div>
</section>
